{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Omarchy for FreeBSD is installed. To finish setting up your desktop:

  1. Enable the required system services (as root):
       sysrc seatd_enable=YES
       sysrc dbus_enable=YES
       service seatd start
       service dbus start

     T1600 Quadro 600 (GF108): nvidia-driver-390 + nvidia-modeset.
     Hyprland cannot run; omg starts Xorg + i3. Reboot after install.

  2. Add your user to the video group (seatd + GPU access, as root):
       pw groupmod video -m <youruser>
     Then log out and back in for the group change to take effect.

  3. Install the Omarchy dotfiles into your home directory:
       omarchy-setup

  4. Log in on a TTY and start the desktop:
       omg

PipeWire and WirePlumber run as user services and are started from Hyprland's
autostart; they are not rc.d services.
EOM
}
